  The article says the bus terminal is 'opposite' (எதிரே) the government hospital, but the draft's headline and caption do not contradict this; however the reel_script describes the buses as stopping 'in a curve' only partially — minor, see next: the draft states buses stop 'when they turn at the curve' which matches the article.
